My approach to resolve the multiple bills creation request for the same latest amount of products in the same time is to use queues,
there are many ways to solve this issue, but I see processing each bill sequentially in in queue by using jobs and queues would solve this issue effectively.
I would create a job and add it to the queue for each create bill request, also using Redis with queues at this stage would make the process faster and more efficient.
This will insure Process one bill at a time with full locking.

